@startuml
title Pati API — Ödeme Webhook, Ledger ve Rezervasyon
skinparam shadowing false
participant "Payment Provider" as PSP
participant "Webhook API" as API
participant "Replay Store" as REP
participant "Payment Module" as PAY
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "Outbox" as OUT
participant "Booking Workflow" as BOOK
PSP -> API : POST /webhooks/payments/{provider}\nID + timestamp + HMAC
API -> API : raw body signature + clock skew
alt Invalid signature
 API --> PSP : 401
else Valid
 API -> REP : claim provider + eventId
 alt Already processed
  API --> PSP : 204
 else New
  API -> PAY : normalize provider event
  PAY -> DB : begin
  PAY -> DB : lock payment by provider id
  PAY -> DB : update payment + append balanced ledger entries
  PAY -> OUT : PaymentAuthorized/Captured/Refunded
  PAY -> DB : commit
  API --> PSP : 204
  OUT -> BOOK : event delivery
  BOOK -> DB : guarded reservation state transition
 end
end
note over PSP,BOOK
Webhook body işlenmeden önce imza doğrulanır.
Ledger update/delete yoktur; düzeltme ters kayıtla yapılır.
end note
@enduml
